# Depth-independent patterns: bare globs like `*.tsbuildinfo` are NOT
# guaranteed to match nested paths in Docker's ignore matcher the way they
# would in .gitignore — this caused a real, reproduced bug where a stray
# host apps/api/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo leaked into the build context and made
# `nest build` silently emit only .d.ts files (incremental compiler thought
# nothing had changed). Every pattern below is explicitly depth-independent.
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/apps/api/generated/
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage/
.git/
.github/
docs/
*.md
